#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "general.liveDashboard.automaticLiveView.desc"
msgid ""
"Automatically switch to a camera's live view when activity is detected. "
"Disabling this option causes static camera images on the Live dashboard to "
"only update once per minute."
msgstr ""

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "general.liveDashboard.playAlertVideos.label"
msgid "Play Alert Videos"
msgstr ""

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "general.liveDashboard.playAlertVideos.desc"
msgid ""
"By default, recent alerts on the Live dashboard play as small looping "
"videos. Disable this option to only show a static image of recent alerts on "
"this device/browser."
msgstr ""

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "general.liveDashboard.displayCameraNames.label"
msgid "Always Show Camera Names"
msgstr ""

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "general.liveDashboard.displayCameraNames.desc"
msgid ""
"Always show the camera names in a chip in the multi-camera live view "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "general.liveDashboard.liveFallbackTimeout.label"
msgid "Live Player Fallback Timeout"
msgstr ""

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "general.liveDashboard.liveFallbackTimeout.desc"
msgid ""
"When a camera's high quality live stream is unavailable, fall back to low "
"bandwidth mode after this many seconds. Default: 3."
msgstr ""

